# Input

```scss
.arguments{color:rgba($exceptionally-long-red-channel, /* green */ $exceptionally-long-green-channel,$exceptionally-long-blue-channel,0.75);
transform:matrix3d(1.000001,0.000002,0.000003,0.000004,0.000005,1.000006,0.000007,0.000008,0.000009,0.000010,1.000011,0.000012,0.000013,0.000014,0.000015,1.000016);}

@include gradient($exceptionally-long-start-color,  $exceptionally-long-middle-color, $exceptionally-long-end-color);

```


# Formatted

```scss
.arguments {
	color: rgba(
		$exceptionally-long-red-channel,
		/* green */ $exceptionally-long-green-channel,
		$exceptionally-long-blue-channel,
		0.75
	);
	transform: matrix3d(
		1.000001,
		0.000002,
		0.000003,
		0.000004,
		0.000005,
		1.000006,
		0.000007,
		0.000008,
		0.000009,
		0.00001,
		1.000011,
		0.000012,
		0.000013,
		0.000014,
		0.000015,
		1.000016
	);
}

@include gradient(
	$exceptionally-long-start-color,
	$exceptionally-long-middle-color,
	$exceptionally-long-end-color
);

```
